  "notes": "Source: Agape College of Business and Science 2023 Catalog (Revision and Print Date 03/25/2024), official PDF at acbscollege.org. Hand-transcribed 2026-09-30. QUARTER CREDITS: Agape uses a quarter-based calendar; all credit values in this file are QUARTER credits as stated in the catalog (p. 'Academic credit is given in quarter credits'). They are not semester credits. Catalog degree outlines give lecture/lab/externship hours per course; only the catalog's stated quarter-credit values are transcribed here. Quarter-by-quarter term placement is the collector's arrangement (the catalog lists courses in tables, not term sequences) and follows catalog prerequisite chains; this is disclosed, not a catalog claim. Prerequisites transcribed only from the catalog's course-description sections (asterisk legend rules applied per program); non-course prerequisites (e.g., 'all courses prior to the last quarter of enrollment') are recorded in choice_note instead of prereq. Program totals: concentration + elective 122, general education 60 = 182 quarter credits (catalog: 2255 total hours). The catalog's 'Elective Total 10' is a categorization within the listed concentration courses (listed courses sum to 122); no separate electives are named. Catalog asterisk rules applied: HCA206's MED prereqs are '*Not applicable to AS Social Work and BS Social Work' -> no prereq; '*BUS112' on ECN214 'Not applicable for ... BS in Social Work' -> no prereq; on MTH306 and SOC325 the same legend gives MTH306 prereq [MTH106] and SOC325 [ENG104, MTH106]; BUS216's '*BUS114' legend lists BS in Social Work as not applicable -> no prereq; SWK201/202/203 prereq SWK101 per catalog. HCA320 prereq recorded verbatim as HCA201 (its exclusion legend is truncated in the PDF extraction; HCA201 is not in the BS Social Work outline). SWK355 catalog prereq: 'SWK101, SWK321, SWK322, SWK335, SWK350, concurrent enrollment in [field seminar]' - concurrent-enrollment clause recorded here in full. Field instruction A/B are 240 externship hours each (8 quarter credits each); SWK250 practicum is 120 hours (4 quarter credits). Exit: 70% overall GPA and completed field requirements. HCA201 is a catalog-listed prerequisite of HCA320, offered in the BS Health Care Administration program; recorded in external_prereqs.",
